  displayName: Purity
  type: Emotion
  text: Your body is a temple. Don't pollute it with 'approved' foods. Only pure,
    natural ingredients can make you truly clean inside.
  debunkingText: "\uFFFDThis is an Appeal to Purity. This emotionally charged language
    is not scientific. Your body is not \"dirty\" or \"polluted\" in the way these
    products claim."
